PS2Recomp sync patch: SIO2 + DualShock2 emulation (IOP side) plus runtime drift sync.

Headline change: emulated SIO2 hardware at 0x1F8082xx (engine + DS2 pad protocol,
IRQ17 dispatch, PCSX2-derived), IopPadInputProvider bridge to the host pad backend,
MHRS_SIO2_AUTOPRESS / MHRS_SIO2_LOG debug env vars.

Also folds in previously unexported working-tree drift (EeScheduler, ps2_memory,
vif1 interpreter, GS frontend/backend tweaks, scePad HLE stub feeding, autopress/frame-dump
debug env vars) and drops a few earlier patch hunks that the actual tree superseded.
Apply after all earlier entries in series.

